_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183240/extras/7f145a6f06ab97ddabc1df6a6db92236.poster.avif?t=1756830460\" width=800 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183240/extras/7f145a6f06ab97ddabc1df6a6db92236.webm?t=1756830460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike typical action fantasy, your spells do not act standalone. Instead, spells empowers your firearm. Your bullets <strong>are your Spell's effects.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Empty magazines full of fire bolts, turn corpses to explosions, or engrave Rituals unto the ground. <strong>Tread the illimitable road of Ritualism.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183240/extras/7f145a6f06ab97ddabc1df6a6db92236.poster.avif?t=1756830460\" width=800 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183240/extras/7f145a6f06ab97ddabc1df6a6db92236.webm?t=1756830460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183240/extras/95af1fcdfadfcaa6f48d3301b99a6e1d.poster.avif?t=1756830460\" width=800 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183240/extras/95af1fcdfadfcaa6f48d3301b99a6e1d.webm?t=1756830460\" 